);
const toggleGroup = (label: string) => setOpenGroups(g => ({ ...g, [label]: !g[label] }));
```

### 6c. Replace the `<nav>` element (lines 378-409) with:
```tsx
<nav className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-2 space-y-1">
