## Step 7: Run TypeScript check

After all files are written, run:
```
cd /home/runner/workspace && npx tsc --noEmit 2>&1
```

Fix any TypeScript errors. Common issues to watch for:
- `useMemo` needs to be imported in assets-entities.tsx if not already there
- The `LinkMaps` type needs to be exported from component-graph.tsx
- The `NAV_GROUPS` type may need `as const` to satisfy the icon typing
- The `openGroups` type needs the group labels as keys

Report what was built and any remaining errors.

